            "review_title": "Review at Coco Thai Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nguyen H\n16 contributions\n0\nJust plain normal but for the price... not likely for me to return here\nSep 2024 • Family\nThe price is a bit on the expensive side but the taste is just plain normal, nothing special especially when you are in district one, surrounded by many better Thai restaurant at a lower price range. The restaurant is a bit hidden so I thought maybe there is something to it but...\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 7, 2024",
